+## `terminal.icon`
+
+Show a terminal with its own icon in the lists, in place of its program's: an .svg or .png under the app's folder (e.g. one a mod wrote under data/), an empty icon goes back to the program's. Kept with the terminal (label herdr.icon), so every Herdr client shows it, and ends with it.
+
+| Argument | Required |
+|---|---|
+| `terminal` | yes |
+| `icon` | yes |
+
